Agentic AI
Simple Definition

Agentic AI is an AI system that can understand a goal, reason, create a plan, use tools, and execute multiple steps to complete a task.

Workflow
--------

Goal
   │
   ▼
Reason
   │
   ▼
Plan
   │
   ▼
Use Tools
   │
   ▼
Execute
   │
   ▼
Result


Real-Time Examples
------------------

| **Example**                | **How it Works**                                                                                              |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Travel Planning Agent**  | Finds flights, compares hotels, checks weather, and creates a travel itinerary.                               |
| **Customer Support Agent** | Understands customer issues, checks order status, retrieves knowledge-base articles, and provides a solution. |


